BraleModule_ComputeRedemptionId
├── when called with a nonce
│   ├── it should equal the local recompute
│   ├── it should be distinct per nonce (fuzz)
│   ├── it should change with the chain id
│   └── it should differ between module instances
└── when reading the typehash
    └── it should equal the literal keccak
